Left Cartel (<span style="color: #FF6699;" class="tooltip-text" title="Republican-Socialist Party">**PRS**</span> + <span style="color: #E0B0FF;" class="tooltip-text" title="Republican, Radical and Radical-Socialist Party">**PRRRS**</span> + <span style="color: #aa4fff;" class="tooltip-text" title="Independent Radicals">**RI**</span> + <span style="color: #F0001C;" class="tooltip-text" title="French Section of the Workers' International">**SFIO**</span> *(toleration)*): [+ left_cartel_coalition +]% 

