@france_coalition_menu

<hr id="read-marker">
<span style="color: #002654;">France</span> is known for its historically unstable governments, with most cabinets lasting a few months at best. The last four years have been governed by various groupings of parties to the right of the <span style="color: #F0001C;">**SFIO**</span>, our <span style="color: #c00000;">socialist</span> comrades. Perhaps it's their turn to rule now, with the return of the Left-Cartel alliance. However, concerns over their radical economic policies may push the <span style="color: #FF6699;">**PRS**</span> and <span style="color: #E0B0FF;">**PRRRS**</span> to form a coalition with the <span style="color: #FFBF00;">**AD**</span> instead.

- @left_cartel_goooooooo
- @minority_millerand
- @majority_millerand


@left_cartel_goooooooo
view-if: left_cartel_coalition >= 50
title: A Left Cartel Coalition will be formed.
choose-if: french_hos == "your mom"
unavailable-subtitle: President Millerand would never appoint any slightly left-wing government.


@majority_millerand
view-if: left_cartel_coalition < 50 and millerand_coalition >= 50
title: A Republican Right Coalition will be formed.
subtitle: Despite the losses in votes the Independent Radicals will join another center-right Coaliton. Frédéric Francois-Marsal will form a government.
on-arrival: france_relation -= 6


@minority_millerand
view-if: left_cartel_coalition >= 50
title: A minority Republican Right Coalition will be formed.
subtitle:  <span style="color: #FFBF00;">**AD**</span> + <span style="color: #005ACA;">**FR**</span> ([+ realistic_millerand_coalition +]%)

Frédéric Francois-Marsal will form a government that can only rely on the support of two parties as the newly formed Popular Democratic Party and the Conservative Monarchists don't seek cooperation with the current administration. The Radicals that have supported previous governments wont tolerate any government that is not formed around the Left Cartel.

It seems the French National Assembly is about to enter a deadlock.














  
